{"id":"n31670-1-9","stage":0,"title":"학생 · 学生","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31670-1-9-1","ko":"버스에 학생들이 너무 많다.","zh":"公交车上的学生太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"버스에","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스에","audio":"/audio/f8530cd07494c8575198.mp3"}},{"text":"학생들이","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학생들이","audio":"/audio/df0a3ceff6a63deb8792.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많다.","meaning":"多","explanation":"많다：多；-다 是非敬语陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1791514425854cb5ac6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31670-1-9-2","ko":"응, 지금이 하교 시간인 모양이야.","zh":"嗯，现在好像是放学时间呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"嗯","explanation":"응：非敬语的肯定回应，相当于“嗯”。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"지금이","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금이","audio":"/audio/e32bcbbecd9f3516ea6f.mp3"}},{"text":"하교","meaning":"放学","explanation":"하교：学校课程结束后学生回家。","readings":[{"term":"하교","audio":"/audio/fb24773b001d837b0a85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85227","senseId":"1","lemma":"하교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하교","audio":"/audio/fb24773b001d837b0a85.mp3"}},{"text":"시간인","meaning":"是……时间","explanation":"시간：时间；-인 修饰后面的 모양，表示“是……时间”。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간인","audio":"/audio/d968dbe319f89fa667d9.mp3"}},{"text":"모양이야.","meaning":"好像是","explanation":"-인 모양이다 表示根据眼前情况作推测；-야 是非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62398","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모양이야","audio":"/audio/16d330bb59cbefac6558.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"嗯","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","d